eferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://person.zju.edu.cn/wangjyee</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>王文海</p></td><td><p>zdzzlab@zju.edu.cn</p></td><td><p><a href=\"https://person.zju.edu.cn/wangweihai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://person.zju.edu.cn/wangweihai</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>王智</p></td><td><p>zjuwangzhi@zju.edu.cn</p></td><td><p><a href=\"http://mypage.zju.edu.cn/wangzhi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://mypage.zju.edu.cn/wangzhi</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>赵春晖</p></td><td><p>chhzhao@zju.edu.cn</p></td><td><p><a href=\"http://mypage.zju.edu.cn/chhzhao\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://mypage.zju.edu.cn/chhzhao</span></a></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>周海峰</p></td><td><p>zhouhaifeng@zju.edu.cn</p></td><td><p><a href=\"https://person.zju.edu.cn/zhouhaifeng\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://person.zju.edu.cn/zhouhaifeng</span></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span> </span></p><p>五、注意事项</p><p><span>1．</span><span>本次夏令营原则上为线上形式，学院不统一安排住宿。</span></p><p><span>2．</span><span>咨询联系</span></p><p>联系人：于老师</p><p>电话：<span>0571-87951921</span></p><p>邮箱：<span>yuling@zju.edu.cn</span>; 请尽量邮箱留言（注明“<span>2026</span>控制夏令营咨询”）。</p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span></span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/ac685bc3027125ddde52.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cse.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/25/ca/26f162d54771af52e2341f8074de/34f8d210-a172-401f-a8d1-67d554e7cc77.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>附件1 工业控制研究所夏令营介绍.docx</span></a><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/ac685bc3027125ddde52.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cse.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/25/ca/26f162d54771af52e2341f8074de/7c6f8b76-a8ea-4268-8558-edad61e28929.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 智能系统与控制研究所夏令营各方向简介.docx</a><span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"4a729848a086a7b0de721453a5e45225804435fe1a21b674029ad62b2fc05962","textLength":2702,"sourceSha256":"62e7d7b02784b6207e54df6577d98de0639099221545dab965b5e14dffed6e5d","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0c5b5f7f597566b397fe","title":"2026年浙江大学控制科学与工程学院2026年“控制之旅”学术夏令营公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:26.384007+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cse.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/ac685bc3027125ddde52.gif"},{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cse.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/ac685bc3027125ddde52.gif"}]}
